          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "Recto",
          "value": "\n<ol><li>... new, and trustworthy regarding people and property, a name is required</li>\n<li>that gathers together all these epithets so that he may be distinguished with these qualities.</li>\n<li>Since you were, oh rightly-guided, prospering and just q\u0101d\u012b, 'Ab\u016b &lsquo;Ish\u0101q</li>\n<li>[&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; ] your satisfaction . . .</li></ol>\n",
